       "text": "I didn't enter this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is five times the labeled maximum of 200 mg per day for adults. A dose that high risks serotonin syndrome, seizures, and cardiac toxicity.\n\nIf 1000 mg was a typo, I can enter one of these instead:\n- **Starting dose:** 25\u201350 mg once daily. Depression, OCD, and similar conditions usually start at 50 mg, and panic disorder and PTSD usually start at 25 mg.\n- **Maintenance dose:** 50\u2013200 mg once daily, titrated to response.\n\nTell me the dose you intended and I'll enter it. If you really do need something above the labeled maximum, that needs to go through pharmacy or the prescriber of record. I can't enter it based on a verbal confirmation."
